  "details": "Meaning, if I click on the black cat it should have a tab that shows verified instances and a tab for non-verified instances, this way they aren't mixed together taking up each others place holders and we have access to more instances especially considering most groups that hold instances are on a power trip.\n\nAn even better idea would be a filter system, meaning if I click on the black cat I can tick off nodes like >verified >east >usa>public or >non-verified>west>jpn>group, and this would filter out all the instances that fit. There could even be a \"both\" option for east/west or group/public, or an \"all\" option for all languages. There could even be a node for high-population, or low-population, or  high to low, or both, etc. Basically, it should be done right and all options should be included as a filter system should.\n\nThank you for your consideration personally I think this filter system would increase activity for both verified and non verified users, and allow players to find exactly what they are looking for and MORE of it.",
